; Parameters py-vcon writes which are proposed to the vCon working group but
; are not in draft-ietf-vcon-vcon-core-05.  They are core rows in
; vcon.parameter_registry (PROPOSED_PARAMETERS).  The unit tests append this
; file to the -05 vcon.cddl so that vCons using them validate.
;
; Dialog in_reply_to and references: email thread reply headers (draft issue 14)
$$dialog-ext //= ( ? in_reply_to: [+ tstr], ? references: [+ tstr] )
; Redacted_string marker: the whole marker string (draft issue 9)
$$redacted-string-ext //= ( ? marker: tstr )
; Redacted_segments channel: the redacted recording channel (draft issue 13)
$$redacted-segments-ext //= ( ? channel: uint )
